# Inside Information exiles Bot2's top two cards, a Meltdown and a Lightning Bolt. Meltdown cast for life has X = 0 (CR 107.3,
# ruling 2026-06-29): Bot1 pays 1 life, its mana value with X as 0, and it destroys only the artifacts of mana value 0 - the
# Mox Ruby and Bot1's own Mox Jet, not Bot2's Mind Stone (2). "You may play those cards this turn": on turn 5 the Bolt still
# in exile is not offered, though Bot1 has the life to pay for it.

